        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lost Resolve is a love letter to speedrunning, featuring a tight movement system that is simple to learn and difficult to master. Whether you're a seasoned pro or a complete beginner, you'll quickly find yourself saying,<i> &quot;yeah, I could have done that faster,&quot;</i> and going for another run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990840/extras/82a9fa1d3aad582e233d0696eb650573.poster.avif?t=1756232164\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990840/extras/82a9fa1d3aad582e233d0696eb650573.webm?t=1756232164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990840/extras/82a9fa1d3aad582e233d0696eb650573.mp4?t=1756232164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here's what you've got to look forward to:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A synergistic set of movement abilities that flow together seamlessly</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 action stages and an interconnected hub world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging boss encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Potential for game-breaking shortcuts and high-skill maneuvers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable abilities to fine-tune your movement kit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A heartfelt story and soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless speedrunning fun</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>So rise up, Soul. Melody needs your help...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lost Resolve is a love letter to speedrunning, featuring a tight movement system that is simple to learn and difficult to master. Whether you're a seasoned pro or a complete beginner, you'll quickly find yourself saying,<i> &quot;yeah, I could have done that faster,&quot;</i> and going for another run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990840/extras/82a9fa1d3aad582e233d0696eb650573.poster.avif?t=1756232164\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990840/extras/82a9fa1d3aad582e233d0696eb650573.webm?t=1756232164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2990840/extras/82a9fa1d3aad582e233d0696eb650573.mp4?t=1756232164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here's what you've got to look forward to:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A synergistic set of movement abilities that flow together seamlessly</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 action stages and an interconnected hub world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging boss encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Potential for game-breaking shortcuts and high-skill maneuvers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable abilities to fine-tune your movement kit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A heartfelt story and soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless speedrunning fun</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>So rise up, Soul. Melody needs your help...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "short_description": "Master your movement skills to blast through exhilarating areas at a breakneck pace. Lost Resolve is a quirky, charming adventure about finding hope in the midst of chaos.",
